# Notice UI theme (default for new UI)

When creating or restyling **dialogs, forms, confirmations, login/select overlays**, use **Notice** — not Aether dark HUD.

Full tokens/docs: `docs/UI_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` (Notice section). Skins: `client/ui/rml/frames/notice/`. Shared CSS: `client/ui/rml/notice.rcss`. Font: `LatoLatin`.

## Pick a layout

| Kind | Clone | Notes |
|------|--------|--------|
| Centered modal | `account.rml` / `region.rml` / `server.rml` | Scrim + `.notice` panel + header/body/footer |
| Slim bottom strip | `selectcha.rml` | No scrim; `.selectcha-bar` with `input_*.tga`; float via `position: absolute; bottom: …` |
| In-game inventory | `inventory.rml` | Notice-inspired light HUD (Character + Backpack + tabs); not Aether |

Do **not** wrap a slim bar in `.notice` panel (baked blue header wastes height).

## Visual recipe

- Panel: off-white + blue header (header baked into `panel_t*` tiles)
- Labels muted `#5a7ab0`; primary text `#2a4a80`
- Gold = secondary/confirm; blue = primary; Exit/Back = `.notice-exit` or compact blue pill
- Disabled: `.notice-btn-disabled` + `disabled` attribute
- Body `pointer-events: none`; interactive shell `pointer-events: auto`
- **Crisp edges:** no soft “inner shadow” / milky halos on panels, inputs, buttons, slots, pills. Flat faces + ~1px strokes; AA feather ≈ `0.35` (see `tools/gen-notice-skin.py` / `tools/gen-inv-slots.py`). Prefer pixel-locked gutters (`44` slot / `4` gap) when laying out grids.

## DX9 hard constraints

- No `box-shadow` / filters
- No large CSS `border-radius` on shells — TGA 9-slice / `tiled-horizontal` only
- `line-height` == control `height`
- Decorator paths: `ui/rml/frames/notice/...` (client cwd)
- Regen skins only: `python tools/gen-notice-skin.py` (inventory extras: `gen-inv-slots.py`, `gen-inv-footer-icons.py`, …)

## New screen checklist

1. Add `*.rml` + thin `*.rcss`; `<link>` `notice.rcss`
2. Mirror `CRmlUiAccountForm` / `CRmlUiSelectChaForm` / `CRmlUiInventoryForm` in `source/**/rmlui/`; load in `CRmlUiManager`
3. Stable element IDs for C++ bindings; `extern` callbacks into the scene
4. Hide legacy `CForm`; hide Rml docs on scene leave (`HideLoginForms` / `HideSelectChaForm` / `HideInventoryForm`)
5. Other in-game HUD windows → Aether (`system/aether.rcss`); **inventory uses Notice-inspired light chrome** (`inventory.rml`)
